<title>UK: London gold fixes at lowest level since March 1995.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes at lowest level since March 1995.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold was fixed at $375.10 per ounce on Monday morning, its lowest fixing since March 2, 1995.</p>
<p>It slipped to 21-month lows last Thursday, when it was fixed at $376.90 and then $377.00.</p>
</text>
